    date "2021-04-15T16:35:36Z"
    title "Tourette Syndrome: The First Step is Learning About The Condition"
    description "The challenges faced as a result of having Tourette Syndrome (TS) and Tic Disorders can have a tremendous toll on the individual. In this video, Davide has #TouretteSyndrome and is showcasing what it's like to be misunderstood due to a lack of understanding of the condition. In an effort to raise #Tourette awareness, please visit tourette.org for resources and information to help educate your local communities and beyond.&#10;&#10;Special thanks to AIST Onlus Italian Association for Tourette Syndrome, in partnership with Watermelon Film and Animation, for the shared use of this creative as a means to raise Tourette Syndrome Awareness globally."
