    label "yJ5M3bqJYcA"
    step 0
    date "2016-09-08T09:22:55Z"
    title "Treating The Most Severe Cases Of Tourettes Syndrome"
    description "Fighting Chance (2014): In this moving report, we meet a family who have to decide whether their son should undergo life-threatening brain surgery, in a last-ditch attempt to stop his Tourette's in its tracks.&#10;&#10;For similar stories, see: &#10;Summer Camp With A Difference: Everyone Has Tourette's&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eI436WsMf2A&#10;The Rock Band Proving That Autism's Got Talent&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vSWBzZ2VNPk&#10;Robo Surgery - Surgery&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vU_4zhph93w&#10;&#10;Subscribe to journeyman for daily uploads: &#10;http://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=journeymanpictures&#10;For downloads and more information visit:&#10;http://www.journeyman.tv/film/6075/fighting-chance&#10;&#10;Like us on Facebook:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/journeymanpictures&#10;Follow us on Twitter:  &#10;https://twitter.com/JourneymanVOD&#10;https://twitter.com/JourneymanNews&#10;Follow us on Instagram:&#10;https://instagram.com/journeymanpictures&#10;&#10;&#34;I feel terrible when I hurt them. I feel like, 'Why am I doing this?'. I feel terrible.&#34; 14-year-old Zack Lamb has one of the most severe cases of Tourette Syndrome in the US. He involuntarily hits out at his family in violent rages. &#34;When he was in a biting mode, he actually took a chunk right out of my arm&#34;, attests his father. With these tics worsening, their situation is desperate. The only procedure that might bring Zack and his family some peace, is a risky operation that involves planting an electrical device, deep in his brain. But can they find a surgeon willing to perform it? &#34;Right now we are just playing Russian roulette with medicine.&#34;&#10;&#10;SBS Australia &#8211; Ref. 6075&#10;&#10;Journeyman Pictures is your independent source for the world's most powerful films, exploring the burning issues of today. We represent stories from the world's top producers, with brand new content coming in all the time. On our channel you'll find outstanding and controversial journalism covering any global subject you can imagine wanting to know about."
