    step 0
    date "2020-01-09T15:36:06Z"
    title "ADHD and Tourette Syndrome"
    description "86% of individuals with Tourette Syndrome have at least one co-occurring condition, such as Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD).&#10;&#10;The Tourette Association of America and Dr. Max Wiznitzer presented a webinar about Tics and ADHD. This webinar discusses the diagnostic criteria for ADHD and how the clinical presentation of ADHD presents from the preschool years to adulthood.  It will also cover the co-occurrence of ADHD, tics and related comorbid disorder and the treatment options and issues associated with co-occurring ADHD and tics.&#10;&#10;Presented by"
