    description "Tim Howard is an American soccer player who plays and captains the MLS club Colorado Rapids as a goalkeeper. Howard is the most capped goalkeeper of all-time for the United States men's national team.&#10;&#10;#MyYoungerSelf by Child Mind Institute is an anti-stigma campaign. We are grateful to Tim for his willingness to open up about his childhood experience with Tourette's syndrome.&#10;&#10;ABOUT CHILD MIND INSTITUTE&#10;As an independent, national nonprofit organization dedicated to transforming the lives of children and families struggling with mental health and learning disorders, we deliver the highest standards of care, advance the science of the developing brain, and empower parents, professionals, and policymakers to support children when and where they need it most.&#10;&#10;&#128213; Related Reading&#10;Guide to Tourette's &#10145; https://childmind.org/guide/tourettes-disorder/"
