    description "Philadelphia-based choreographer Sutie Madison, who suffers from Tourette syndrome, created a modern dance based on the tics and twitches associated with the neurological disorder. She gave her dancers a DVD of medical footage cataloguing the range of movements which patients are compulsively prone to act out. Here are exerpts from that DVD.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;You can see the footage of the dance on which these movements are based at http://www.newsworks.org/index.php/local/item/31367"
