    title "Transitioning into adulthood for individuals with Tourette Syndrome"
    description "Developing from a teenager to a young adult can be a challenging and rewarding process, especially for individuals with Tourette Syndrome. Dr. Anthony Rostain and Dr. Marc Schmidt joined the Tourette Association of America for a Facebook Live to discuss the process of transitioning from childhood to adulthood. Through self-advocacy as well as recognizing and utilizing their strengths, young adults can feel empowered to take control over their life."
