  node [
    id 114
    label "LbDT0oGTbCU"
    step 0
    date "2016-08-09T20:00:42Z"
    title "John Phillips, CNN commentator, says Trump has Tourette Syndrome"
    description "There have been several references made by media personalities about Donald Trump having Tourette Syndrome. These comments serve to perpetuate the stigma that hundreds of thousands of people with Tourette face every day. Tourette isn&#8217;t curable, but can be debilitating, painful and almost always leads to being stigmatized.&#10;&#10;The Tourette Association of America is dedicated to raising awareness and acceptance, advancing research, and providing support for all people affected by Tourette Syndrome and other Tic Disorders. But our work &#8211; and the lives of those with Tourette and Tics &#8211; is much harder when the media makes Tourette a punchline. It&#8217;s time to reverse the stigma.&#10;&#10;With your great influence and wide reach, we invite you to be part of the solution. Please help the 1 in 100 school aged children who are affected by Tourette Syndrome or another Tic Disorder be understood. Please help the hundreds of thousands of adults who live with symptoms their whole lives get jobs, form relationships and live full lives. Everyone experiences Tourette differently, but they share the common struggles of being bullied and misunderstood."
    channeltitle "Tourette Association of America"
    channelid "UC91zpIYK_8Pwu48EZkLetUg"
