    title "ONE Feature | Amir Khan Overcomes Tourette Syndrome"
    description "Life was very different for Amir Khan growing up. Long before he was the all-conquering knockout artist he is today, the Singaporean sensation was a target of bullies due to his neurological disorder. However, his discovery of Muay Thai helped Khan control his involuntary muscle tics. After tearing through the ONE lightweight division, he is now on the verge of achieving a lifelong dream, taking on Filipino icon Eduard Folayang for the ONE Lightweight World Title at ONE: WARRIOR'S DREAM in Manila.&#10;&#10;Subscribe to ONE Championship on YouTube: http://bit.ly/ONECHAMPIONSHIP&#10;&#10;Connect with ONE Championship: &#10;&#10;ONE Super App: http://bit.ly/ONESuperApp&#10;Website: https://onefc.com/ &#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/ONEChampionship&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/ONEChampionship&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/onechampionship"
