  node [
    id 138
    label "Q5FFVqmmiYY"
    step 0
    date "2019-12-18T00:00:02Z"
    title "How Does She Stream on Twitch with Tourette Syndrome?"
    description "Alright guys, we&#8217;ve talked a lot about Twitch bans on this show.&#10;&#10;Streamers getting banned for the crazy stuff they&#8217;ve done, what they&#8217;ve said and what they didn&#8217;t say or do. Sometimes the people involved in those stories rage against Twitch, sometimes they appeal for justice in the face of injustice, and sometimes they break down and cry. &#10;&#10;But today&#8217;s different.&#10;&#10;Imagine, through no fault or intent of your own, you were prone to uncontrollably say things that, on their own -- without a shred of context -- could be offensive, insulting and DEFINITELY ban-worthy.&#10;&#10;Well, that&#8217;s the reality a streamer named Sweet Anita faces every single day.&#10;&#10;Written and Hosted by: Colin McNeil (@McNeilColin) &#10;Edited by: Andrew Faigal (@Brrrning)&#10;&#10;Footage courtesy of: &#10;&#10;The Clip That Started It All&#10;Courtesy: Sweet Anita&#10;https://youtu.be/NE273i101kc&#10;&#10;Summity apologizes to Sweet Anita&#10;Courtesy: summit1g&#10;https://clips.twitch.tv/PeacefulTrustworthyPidgeonAliens&#10;&#10;Music used under license from Associated Production Music LLC (&#8221;APM&#8221;).&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Follow us on Twitter: http://twitter.com/thescoreesports&#13;&#10;Follow us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/theScoreesports&#13;&#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://instagram.com/theScoreesports"
