    title "ONE Feature | Amir Khan Conquers Tourettes Syndrome"
    description "Long before he became ONE's knockout king, Amir Khan was a shy child who was constantly picked on for suffering with Tourette&#8217;s syndrome. However, the Singaporean sensation&#8217;s turned his life around when he discovered mixed martial arts. Not only has the sport taught him to have better control over his involuntary tics, but it has given him a successful career, which has culminated in a lightweight World Title shot at ONE: CONQUEST OF CHAMPIONS in Manila. &#10;&#10;Subscribe to ONE Championship on YouTube: http://bit.ly/ONECHAMPIONSHIP&#10;&#10;Connect with ONE Championship: &#10;&#10;ONE Super App: http://bit.ly/ONESuperApp&#10;Website: https://onefc.com/ &#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/ONEChampionship&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/ONEChampionship&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/onechampionship"
