    title "What is Tourettes Syndrome? ft. Squeak Code!"
    description "Check out Squeak Code: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCP2cfi2T2FaNLyb75sraXTQ&#10;&#10;Donate to the International OCD Foundation and sponsor Team Shalom Aleichem at the OCD 5k: :) https://www.crowdrise.com/thekatway-1Million4OCD2016-Atl/fundraiser/thekatway&#10;&#10;It's FINALLY UPLOADED! :D It took an extra week, but I finally finished my video to innitiate Tourette's Syndrome Awareness month on my channel. HUGE thanks to Sqeak Code for coming on my channel to talk about this. Experience teaches more than research ever can! &#10;&#10;Hope you guys are doing great! Keep breaking stigma and spreading awareness of mental AND neurological health. :)&#10;&#10;Donate to the International OCD Foundation and sponsor Team Shalom Aleichem at the OCD 5k: :) https://www.crowdrise.com/thekatway-1Million4OCD2016-Atl/fundraiser/thekatway&#10;&#10;&#10;Shalom, Kat&#10;&#10;NEW OCD Blog: https://doanexposure.wordpress.com/&#10;(PS. Aimed for young adult/adult readers).&#10;&#10;Tumblr: http://doanexposure.tumblr.com/&#10;&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/thekatway&#10;&#10;Snapchat: @thekatway&#10;&#10;Need help for OCD? Go to: https://iocdf.org/about-ocd/finding-help/&#10;&#10;Read My OCD Story: http://theocdstories.com/religious-ocd/learning-to-live/&#10;&#10;Watch me on The OCD Stories' podcast: http://theocdstories.com/podcast/kat-nicole-on-beating-and-learning-to-live-after-ocd/"
