    title "Flying Anne: Growing up with Tourettes syndrome"
    description "Anne is 11 and has Tourette&#8217;s syndrome. She also has a great love of life&#10;&#10;Subscribe to the Aeon Video newsletter: https://bit.ly/2MfCgqO&#10;Watch 'Flying Anne' on Aeon: https://bit.ly/3oYWJBT&#10;Watch more free videos on Aeon: https://bit.ly/35DJcpb&#10;Subscribe on YouTube: https://bit.ly/2EQf1zv&#10;Follow us on Twitter: https://bit.ly/2SaTMjt&#10;Follow us on Facebook: https://bit.ly/2MgoDrg&#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://bit.ly/2tDzsNC&#10;&#10;Catherine van Campen&#8217;s film follows 11-year-old Anne through the long and willful days of childhood as she reflects on her hopes and fears. Unlike most other 11-year-olds, however, Anne has Tourette&#8217;s syndrome, which manifests itself in involuntary tics and urges. The film is an affecting portrait of growing up different at an age of trying to fit in.&#10;&#10;Director: Catherine van Campen&#10;Producer: Joost Seelen&#10;&#10;#Netherlands #tourettes #medicine"
