    date "2021-07-25T14:36:07Z"
    title "Doctor REACTS to SOUTH PARK | Psychiatrist Analyzes Tics  Tourette Syndrome | Doctor Elliott"
    description "#doctorreacts #drelliott #southpark #psychiatrist #mentalhealth #tourettes&#10;&#10;Check out my reaction to Bojack Horseman: https://youtu.be/k6DqqKDm6Lk&#10;It's a Sin reviews: https://youtu.be/KiHx8GHTem8&#10;&#10;&#10;WARNING/DISCLAIMER: as you'd expect with South Park, there is some swearing on this episode, but I've only included clips that are actually relevant to learning about Tourette's syndrome.&#10;&#10;&#10;This Doctor Reacts episode is looking at an episode of South Park called &#34;Le petit Tourette&#34;. It's all about Tourette syndrome - a chronic tic disorder characterised by persistent motor and vocal tics. There are lots of myths especially about its association with impulsive swearing (called coprolalia). Surprisingly, if you look past the swearing, you'll see some really accurate and compassionate information about this condition. &#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE for new videos every Sat and every Wed: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4x1bU7IAE6619NFCJpD74A&#10;&#10;Connect with me on socials:&#10;Twitter: @elcarthy&#10;Instagram: @dr.elliott.carthy"
