    date "2017-09-28T13:58:43Z"
    title "Cheerleader With Tourette Syndrome Defies Misconceptions: "
    description "A high school cheerleader is setting the record straight about a misunderstood disorder. Jane Hamilton, 14, is a high school sophomore who has Tourette Syndrome. Sometimes to make herself angry, Jane looks at YouTube clips of Tourette's, which display misconceptions about the condition. She finds cheerleading challenging, but says, &#34;I'm not a quitter!&#34; Jane wants to spread the message that people with Tourette's &#34;can do whatever they want.&#34; #InsideEdition"
