  node [
    id 195
    label "PLRU28sA9zE"
    step 0
    date "2021-05-24T14:00:14Z"
    title "Billie Eilish Tourettes Syndrome | HOW Does She CONTROL The Tics?!"
    description "Billie Eilish has been killing it recently with a Vogue magazine cover and new world tours. In her magazine article, she mentioned about how she was abused when she was younger. This hugely impacted her psychologically. This is very interesting considering that we know she has Tourette&#8217;s Syndrome. In this video, I go through what Tourette&#8217;s Syndrome is, the type of Tics Billie gets and how she controls them.&#10;&#10;It takes her a load of planning to keep it under control especially while she&#8217;s stressed. That being said, major props to her for keeping up with the tour and active lifestyle while managing her condition. She certainly is an example to many people out there who are finding it difficult to get by with the condition. For anyone watching this video with Tourette&#8217;s Syndrome, I wish you health and happiness.&#10;&#10;The links to the Essential oil blends that she mentions in the video are below.&#10;&#10;Essential Oils Blend UK: https://amzn.to/3uaXYiu&#10;&#10;Essential Oils Blend US: https://amzn.to/3fAvJor&#10;&#10;My Itinerary by Tokyo Music Walker https://soundcloud.com/user-356546060... Attribution 3.0 Unported (CC BY 3.0) https://creativecommons.org/licenses/... Music provided by Free Vibes: https://goo.gl/NkGhTg&#10;&#10;Please note that links may or may not be affiliate links which means if you make a purchase after clicking them, you&#8217;ll be supporting the channel. It costs nothing extra to use them .&#10;&#10;Like and Subscribe and I&#8217;ll see you in the next video!&#10;&#10;Chapters&#10;00:00 Intro&#10;00:40 Billie Eilish Talking About Having Tourette's&#10;02:00 What is Tourette's Syndrome?&#10;03:43 How to Treat Tourette's Syndrome&#10;05:12 How does Billie Eilish Control Her Tics?&#10;11:52 Planning to Have Tics Subtly&#10;13:32 Outlook for Tourette's&#10;14:24 Outro&#10;&#10;------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Go follow my socials &#128214; :&#10;&#10;Insta &#127750;: www.instagram.com/drsermedmezher&#10;Twitter &#128173;: https://twitter.com/drsermedmezher&#10;&#10;------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;#BillieEilish #Tourette&#8217;s #Tics"
