  node [
    id 198
    label "dxdyL2RrLjw"
    step 0
    date "2018-06-05T17:34:52Z"
    title "What Its Like To Date Someone With Tourette Syndrome"
    description "DISCLAIMER: This video's purpose is to shed positivity and have a lighthearted take on Tourette Syndrome. I am immensely sorry if our lighthearted take or conversation offends anyone. I understand that Tourette Syndrome is a very serious condition and can be very hard to deal with. I hope that this video encourages people to stay positive and look for people who will appreciate you no matter how &#34;different&#34; you are from society's &#34;normal&#34;!&#10;&#10;Thank you so much Aaron for making this video with me! (Sorry this Mia Monday was posted on a Tuesday due to uploading issues).&#10;&#10;Update: As a group we decided to step away from this channel for the end of the school year to focus on our studies but we are back for the summer! You can expect weekly videos about summer adventures, our experiences during school, some more introductions, and more!&#10;&#10;Don't forget to keep up with me on Instagram: @mia.mantei&#10;Or contact me through my email: miamanteitsya@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Thanks again for watching and supporting our channel and cause!"
