    label "DOH1gqrw9UI"
    step 0
    date "2017-07-21T13:49:34Z"
    title "High School Epidemic: The Tourette Syndrome Outbreak"
    description "SUBSCRIBE for more Naked Stories: http://bit.ly/2ol5mam  &#10;&#10;Mass hysteria or a chemical spill? &#10;&#10;Famed environmentalist Erin Brockovich investigated this mass outbreak of Tourettes-like symptoms that affected mainly female students in a small US town during 2011 and 2012. &#10;&#10;Although most paediatric neurologists diagnosed the varying symptoms as conversion disorders, there has been no established cause as to the outbreak of the mass psychogenic illness.&#10;&#10;Theories include use of the legal high &#8216;Spice&#8217;, emotional stress, poor air quality - and a chemical spill of cyanide crystals and trichloroethylene that happened near the high-school grounds in the 70s&#8230;&#10;&#10;&#10;Clip from The Town That Caught Tourettes, 2012. Content licensed from Raw TV. For any enquiries, please contact us at info@passiondistribution.com"
