    date "2021-05-04T13:47:16Z"
    title "Front of the Class (Full Movie) - Tourette Syndrome"
    description "#BradCohen #TouretteSyndrome #InspirationalMovie #DisabilityAwareness&#10;&#10;This movie is all about a boy (Brad Cohen) who has a Tourette syndrome but is able to overcome criticism and discrimination to achieve his dream of becoming a teacher.&#10;&#10;Ready some tissue paper 'coz I am certain that this film will definitely make you cry and will make you realize that disability is never a hindrance to be successful.&#10;&#10;YOU CAN ALWAYS BE AMAZING, AWESOME, AND WONDERFUL... REGARDLESS OF WHAT OR WHO YOU ARE! &#10;&#10;So, in spite of everything, just go on and know that you have a special place in the world. You matter. You exist because you have a purpose.&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;Video is NOT mine. &#10;Credit to the owner  @TheEternauta666 especially for the subtitles in Chinese &#38; in English... &#10;Link: https://youtu.be/P6UWIGrsxM4&#10;------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;#bradcohen2021 #bradcohenfrontoftheclass #bradcoheninterview #bradcohenkodakblack #bradcohenlawyer #bradcohenmiami #bradcohenmovie #bradcohenspeech #bradcohenstory #bradcohensurfside #bradcohenteaching #bradcohentourettesyndrome #bradcohenwife #chineselovestorymovieswithenglishsubtitlesfullmovie #chinesemoviewithenglishsubtitlesfullmovie #chineseromanticmoviewithenglishsubtitles #chinesesad movieswithenglishsubtitlesfullmovie #disabilityandsex #disabilityawareness #disabilitybenefits #disabilitydiscrimination #disabilitydocumentary #disabilityfraudcaught #disabilitygamer #disabilityistheinabilitytoseeabilitycartoon #disabilityjustice #disabilitymobility #disabilitypridemonth #disabilityrightsmovement #disabilitytiktok #englishfullmovie2018 #englishfullmovie2019 #englishfullmovie2020 #englishfullmovie2020newreleases #englishfullmovie2021 #englishfullmovieaction #englishfullmovieaction2020hindi #englishfullmoviecomedy #englishfullmoviehd #englishfullmoviehindidubbed #englishfullmovieinhindi #englishfullmovienew #englishmovie