    label "TBVMNywLaE8"
    step 0
    date "2016-04-05T14:45:52Z"
    title "Before and After: New TMJ Treatment with Tourettes Syndrome Patient"
    description "Kenny, our patient with Tourette's is in town because he was nominated for the Tourette's Ambassador Program. While in town he stopped by our office for an adjustment on his lower orthotic Gelb appliance. In this video Kenny lets us know that his head movements have diminished and he is much more relaxed with his appliance in. The urge to tic has lessened and his mother is very happy with his progress. Years later Kenny stops by while in town for another Tourette's Ambassador Program Conference. He gives us a quick update on how his treatment went and he gives his advice to everyone. Kenny is now starting the last phase of treatment and we could not be happier for him. It is so wonderful to catch up with our patients!&#10;&#10;Feel free to share this video! If you have any questions, please give us a call at the office. Our phone number is 703-821-1103 and you can email us at office@sleepandtmjtherapy.com&#10;&#10;**Check out our social media sites!**&#10;www.sleepandtmjtherapy.com&#10;https://plus.google.com/+SleepTMJTherapyVienna/about&#10;https://twitter.com/SleepTMJTherapy&#10;http://sleepandtmjtherapy.com/blog/"
    channeltitle "Sleep &#38; TMJ Therapy"
