    title "SEAMUS EVANS ON TOURETTE SYNDROME"
    description "Acceptance, passion and determination&#8230;&#10; &#10;Seamus Evans is a Keynote Speaker, Comedian, Tourette Syndrome Ambassador, and heaps more! With all of this under his belt you&#8217;d best believe he has a tonne of wisdom, and we were super lucky to have him join our friends from Jacaranda Place for a special talk.&#10; &#10;Seamus authentically shared his story and captured the attention of the young people as he spoke about his journey with Tourette Syndrome - from the everyday struggles to full embrace.&#10; &#10;Thanks so much Seamus for your openness and generosity! &#10;&#10;Copyright Juiced Enterprises 2021&#10;&#10; &#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226;&#8226; &#10;&#10;Copyright Disclaimer Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &#34;fair use&#34; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favour of fair use."
