    title "Teen With Tourette Syndrome: I Was Booted From "
    description "A teen and her family say they were angered when they were asked to leave a movie theater because of the 15-year-old's Tourette syndrome. Emily Womack's mom, Tina, said the manager told her nine people had complained about Emily's squawking. She said she told him it wouldn't be a problem during the movie and that Emily could suppress it. The theater said its team attempted to resolve this situation without anyone having to leave the movie. InsideEdition.com's Leigh Scheps has more. #InsideEdition"
