    step 0
    date "2014-08-29T15:16:10Z"
    title "Tourettes syndrome sufferer tells of debilitating disease"
    description "A bingo-loving young man has been banned from his favourite hall for shouting out and swearing during games &#8211; because he has TOURETTE&#8217;S. Louis Bunn was kicked out of his local bingo hall, and banned for life, after staff thought his involuntary tics and movements were deliberate acts of disruption. The 23-year-old, of Eastbourne, East Sussex, was booted out of Leo Leisure Bingo last Sunday, in the middle of a game. Louis, whose involuntary swearing becomes worse when he&#8217;s stressed, says that during the course of the evening, the bingo caller poked fun at his accidental outbursts."
