    date "2022-05-13T18:00:16Z"
    title "Tourette Syndrome | How I Got The Diagnosis"
    description "Hey! In this video I share the story of how I got my Tourette Syndrome diagnosis (even though my tics are likely actually caused by PANS). Getting a Tourette&#8217;s diagnosis isn't always easy or straightforward unfortunately.&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: I am NOT a medical professional, this is NOT to be used as a substitute for diagnosis or treatment from a qualified physician, this is to be used for educational purposes only. For medical advice, please see a medical practitioner. I do NOT claim to treat, cure or mitigate any condition.&#10;&#10; &#10;Useful Links:&#10;&#10;&#10;Ticcers unite website: https://www.ticcersunite.com/&#10;&#10;The Legacy initiative - International peer support and virtual meet ups by Logan Isfeld: https://www.freeyouthsupport.com/&#10; &#10;PANS / PANDAS:&#10;&#10;&#10;PANDAS PANS UK :&#10;https://www.panspandasuk.org/&#10;&#10;&#10;Moleculara labs:&#10;https://www.moleculeralabs.com/pans-diagnostic-criteria/&#10;&#10;&#10;The Foundation for Children with Neuroimmune Disorders:&#10;https://www.neuroimmune.org/&#10;&#10;&#10;The Alliance to Solve PANS and Immune Related Encephalopathies: https://aspire.care/&#10;&#10;Cute images in the thumbnail are from the Kawaii! stickers app, which I highly recommend."
