    title "This is me! Cello, music and Tourettes Syndrome"
    description "I have made a video all about sending out a message to people about me and my Tourette's Syndrome and to not let their Tourettes or any conditions define them or stop them from doing anything that they want to do. I even went to the beach to film a lot of this playing Bach Cello Suite No.1. Please watch this video and share it with all of your friends and family as I hope that it will open People&#8217;s minds and show what can be achieved, even if you have a disability like I do! :) Xx Subscribe to Wilamena's blog at https://www.tictastic.com"
