    title "TRY NOT TO TIC CHALLENGE//Tourette Syndrome"
    description "Hey guys! Not sure how many of you know, but I have Tourette Syndrome! I usually don't show my tics in most of my videos because I edit it out, but I figured I'd be real with you guys and let you know all of my different tics! This video was pretty fun to make, and while watching it I can't help but laugh, so please don't feel bad if you find it funny!! I really hope you enjoyed this video about my Tourette Syndrome! If you did, please hit that thumbs up button and SUBSCRIBE for more fun content!! Bye! &#10;&#10;Email for business inquires only: camillescurls@gmail.com&#10;&#10;LINKS/COUPONS:&#10;Verb Products: https://www.verbproducts.com/?rfsn=2653071.48a3c3 (16% off first purchase!)&#10;Lavish outfitters: curlycamille15 (15% off your order!) https://www.lavishoutfitters.com/&#10;HipOptical: CAMILLE ($10 off your order!) https://www.hipoptical.com/&#10;&#10; LETS BE FRIENDS!!&#10;     &#10032;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/camilles_curls/&#10;     &#10032;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/mumy82/&#10;     &#10032;Snapchat: https://www.snapchat.com/add/mumy.82&#10;&#10;MUSIC: Lukrembo (amazing youtube artist!)&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;FAQ:&#10;age: 17 (18 in June)&#10;camera: Canon 70D&#10;lenses: 18-55mm and 50mm&#10;editing software: Adobe Premiere Pro CC&#10;are you going to be a big youtuber one day? YES!&#10;Should you subscribe? YES YES YES YES&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product or service with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission. There is no additional charge to you! Thank you so much for supporting me and helping my channel grow!&#10;&#10;Sub count: 265 :) &#10;&#10;#Tourettes #TouretteSyndrome"
