    description "Hi, I'm Bailey Womack.  I am 16 years old, and I am a sufferer of severe Tourette's Syndrome.  This video helps me through those hard times, and hopefully it can do the same for you. Please, I would like to ask that no one leave any negative or derogatory comments. The following websites are sites to help those with Tourette's Syndrome: &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;http://www.lifesatwitch.com/home.html&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;http://www.petitiononline.com/teensWts/petition.html&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;http://www.webmd.com/brain/tourette-syndrome-overview&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;http://www.webmd.com/brain/news/20051013/gene-link-to-tourettes-syndrome-found&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;http://www.tsa-usa.org/&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Thank you for your time."
