  node [
    id 241
    label "Hy6cN72U33g"
    step 0
    date "2020-07-23T00:57:33Z"
    title "TOURETTES SYNDROME - TIK TOK COMPILATION"
    description "Why include random videos?&#10;They are not random. Many of our viewers are people who have tourettes syndrome. Some of these viewers tell me that as much as they love to watch tourettes compilations they find the videos often set off their own tics. I usually include a different kind of video every 3-4 clips as an effort to distract or calm these viewers so that they are not bombarded with tic after tic after tic.&#10;Thank you for your understanding and thank you for helping this channel to grow. No matter what I upload or how much work I put into this channel it can be nothing without YOU, the person reading this!&#10;&#10;Its time for your tik tok tourettes syndrome compilation from T3 Trends!&#10;&#10;#TikTok #TOURETTES #TOURETTESAWARENESS&#10;&#10;&#128077; Remember to like and share it with your friends if you enjoyed it! &#128077;&#10;&#10;&#128165; SUBSCRIBE, don't miss out on any of our compilations! &#128165;&#10;&#10;Subscribe to T3 Trends: https://fatcattv.com/c&#10;Find us on Facebook:  fb.me/T3Trends&#10;&#10;&#128165;Check out our AWESOME TikTok compilations:&#128165;&#10;&#10;&#9658; Funny TikToks: &#129315;&#10;https://fatcattv.com/p/PLOx7hkvSQl_eq_tkoZknqHOnC_8qqAfP4&#10;&#10;&#9658;TikTok Makeup: &#128132;&#10;https://fatcattv.com/p/PLOx7hkvSQl_emQ7V4FmP1V7xvczrbqQeD&#10;&#10;&#9658;TikTok Animals: &#128049;&#128054; &#129418;&#10;https://fatcattv.com/p/PLOx7hkvSQl_d_uARsGG-aRsLM__3OcQ-7"
