    label "bxM_x1dhcLw"
    step 0
    date "2021-04-18T11:00:11Z"
    title "More Tics in Class | Tourettes Syndrome"
    description "Here's more footage I found of my tics in class back last year.&#10;(for reference I am not allowed to film anymore so this is all old footage)&#10;&#10;I have Tourettes Syndrome and this is what it can be like being in class with someone who has Tourettes. It can be very distracting but please remember I can't control it and it frustrates me a lot more than anyone else, I can assure you!&#10;My classmates are used to it so I don't stop anyone from working, and I don't film in any classes that aren't either substitutes or at break/lunch times so don't worry :)&#10;&#10;My Social Media:&#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/zara.bethx/&#8203;&#10;Tiktok - https://vm.tiktok.com/JF5QVtc/&#8203;&#10;https://linktr.ee/zarabeth&#8203;&#10;&#10;My name is Zara Beth (zeezee25 on tiktok) and I post videos about tics, tic disorders and what its like to be a teen living with Tourette's syndrome. I show what its like having tics and Tourettes in class and in school, and I also bake, do other challenges and answer all your questions."
