  node [
    id 248
    label "AGiMGNF0uAI"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-22T09:42:02Z"
    title "Ellies Makeup Video | Tourette Syndrome"
    description "Ellie asked me if she could use my makeup and make a video, and it's hard to say no to her... so I didn't, LOL! This was a nor'easter day here on the Outer Banks and Ellie really hates bad weather so this kept her so joyful and distracted! It seems like it goes well in the beginning, but, when she got to the lipstick, her Tourette's decided to change up her look, LOL! We love watching her enjoy life and just be fully herself. Her tics were more mild when we filmed this but in the past week since have increased again and this seems to be the wave she rides with her Tourette's! &#10;&#10;Thank you for being here. She really just wants other kids to see that her life is still happy with tics and that they are perfect just the way they are. We really appreciate our community dearly! XOXO &#10;&#10;For more Tourette syndrome awareness from us on Instagram: @amandahedgepethobx"
    channeltitle "Amanda Hedgepeth"
