    title "Tourette Syndrome explained in Tamil | #Hichki | Rani Mukerjee | #Naampondicherry"
    description "Explains about a physiological disfunctioning of our brain called as Tourette Syndrome.&#10;&#10;#Hichki was a movie starred by #Ranimukerjee where she plays a role as a victim of Tourette Syndrome, the other person in the thumbnail is #Brad Cohen, who was a real victim of Tourette Syndrome, but survived and succeeded it, who is an absolute inspiration.&#10;&#10;*****************************************************&#10;MY GEARS:&#10;&#10084;&#65039; MIC 1: Zoom H1n Handy Recorder (Red Edition) - https://amzn.to/2YehzEg&#10;&#10084;&#65039; MIC 2: Sony ECM-CS3 Tie Clip Microphone&#10;&#10084;&#65039; CAMERA: Nikon D5600 DSLR Camera - https://amzn.to/3gURKj6&#10;&#10084;&#65039; LENS : Nikon AF-S Nikkor 50 mm f/1.8G Prime Lens - https://amzn.to/3kI10rW&#10;&#10084;&#65039; LENS : Nikon AF-S DX Nikkor 18-140mm F/3.5-5.6 G ED VR Zoom - https://amzn.to/3mVoGvE&#10;&#10084;&#65039; TRIPOD 1: AmazonBasics 60-Inch Lightweight Tripod - https://amzn.to/3yuhed6&#10;&#10084;&#65039; TRIPOD 2: DIGITEK&#174; (DTR 260 GT) Gorilla - https://amzn.to/3jwOWKQ&#10;&#10084;&#65039; LIGHTING: Godox LED RGB Light Stick LC500R - https://amzn.to/2WBx3C3&#10;&#10084;&#65039; LAPTOP: Apple MacBook M1 chip with 8-core CPU and 8-core GPU - https://amzn.to/3jyWsor&#10;&#10084;&#65039; MOBILE: Vivo V20 (Sunset Melody, 8GB RAM, 128GB Storage)- https://amzn.to/2WC8pAK&#10;&#10084;&#65039; EDITING SOFTWARE : Imovies - Developed by Apple Inc. for macOS, iOS, and iPadOS devices&#10;*****************************************************&#10;Follow Us on :&#10;&#128073; Instagram          &#10084;&#65039; https://www.instagram.com/naampondicherry/&#10;&#128073; YouTube             &#10084;&#65039; https://www.youtube.com/c/NAAMPondicherry&#10;&#128073; Facebook Page &#10084;&#65039; https://www.facebook.com/naampondicherry/&#10;*****************************************************&#10;PLEASE STAY CONNECT WITH US BY SUBSCRIBING OUR CHANNEL&#10;&#10084;&#65039; If you like this video, please hit the &#34;Like&#34; Button.&#10;&#10084;&#65039; If you found this video useful, please do &#34;Subscribe&#34; Our Channel and click the &#34;Bell Icon&#34; to get notified for our latest videos.&#10;&#10084;&#65039; If you love this video, please do &#34;share&#34; the video.&#10;*****************************************************&#10;For promotion &#38; business inquires please mail us at : naampondicherry@gmail.com&#10;*****************************************************&#10;&#128683; DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#128073; Copyright Disclaimer under section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for &#8220;fair use&#8221; for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, education and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing.&#10;&#128073; Use or commercial display or editing of the content without proper authorization is not allowed&#10;&#128073; This video and description contain affiliate links, which means that if you click on one of the product links, I'll receive a small commission. This helps support the channel and allows us to continue to make videos like this. &#10;*****************************************************&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;With regards,&#10;Naam Pondicherry &#38; Team"
