  node [
    id 258
    label "MppxRVxKaao"
    step 0
    date "2014-05-08T16:36:44Z"
    title "Tourettes Tic ATTACKS - Tourette syndrome"
    description "Im not doing well. My health is poor which is why I have made few videos lately. I try though for you guys and it means a lot to me when I put out a video.&#10;The attack that you see in this vid....I get nearly every day and often multiple times a day. Some can last 5 minutes while another can last nearly 2 hours. This is my life right now.&#10;&#10;I'm not looking for pity but I think this video can bring a certain amount of awareness to this aspect of tourettes that can resemble other movement disorders such as epilepsy or dystonia. Not enough people know that this can happen with tourettes and I think its time that they did.&#10;&#10;This is the article on tic attacks I mentioned where they are doing a study on this kind of tourettes attack in London.&#10;http://jnnp.bmj.com/content/84/11/e2.77.abstract&#10;&#10;Comment, thumbs up! And SUBSCRIBE!!&#10;&#10;Support my channel  https://www.patreon.com/Idranktheseawater?ty=h&#10;&#10;Find me on....&#10;Instagram https://www.instagram.com/melissacwater/&#10;Facebook   https://www.facebook.com/pages/Idrank...&#10;Tumblr  http://idranktheseawater-is-me.tumblr.com&#10;Twitter https://twitter.com/MelissaCwater&#10;My comedy channel  http://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSHGd...&#10;French Mental Health Channel  https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvijSZJsbCp_fvlhRGlSHOw&#10;Google +    https://plus.google.com/1074016377189...&#10;My Author Page http://www.amazon.com/Melissa-C.-Water/e/B00FY5WM1Q/ref=ntt_dp_epwbk_0"
