  node [
    id 259
    label "j5GXHHaporY"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-01T05:00:27Z"
    title "Overcoming My Tourettes Syndrome w/ Sam Hanson"
    description "A persistent cough and clearing of the throat seemed plausible when his allergy panel came back positive for a plethora of allergens. When symptoms persisted after medication, Sam Hanson knew there had to be more to his diagnosis.&#10;&#10;Tourette&#8217;s syndrome is a neurodevelopmental disorder that begins during childhood or adolescence. Having battled movement (motor) and vocal (phonic) tics during his youth, Sam knew he had this disorder before he had a professional diagnosis. Learning to thrive with this syndrome hasn&#8217;t always been easy, but with practice and patience Sam is figuring it out! &#10;&#10;Listen in to hear how Sam found strength in sharing his truth and how he is empowering others with this syndrome to do the same!&#10;&#10;--&#10;&#10;In a world filled with remarkable human beings, it's my mission to shed light on some of the stories and lessons we accrue during our time here.&#10;&#10;Listen to 'The World With Nate Podcast' anywhere you listen to podcasts.&#10;&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/theworldwithnatepodcast/&#10;Anchor (podcasts): http://anchor.fm/theworldwithnate"
