    title "Reading Hate Comments || Tourettes Syndrome"
    description "hiii! bit of a different video today, not the nicest but hey it only makes us stronger. &#10;&#10;sometimes my tourettes answered for me so&#128556;&#128514;&#10;&#10;&#9888;&#65039;i want to add, i didn&#8217;t realise but some names i haven&#8217;t scribbled out. please please do not message them. i don&#8217;t want any drama, and that&#8217;s not the intention of this video. please respect my wishes, thank you&#9829;&#65039;&#9888;&#65039;&#10;&#10;hope you enjoy! have a great day&#9786;&#65039;&#128155;"
