    date "2018-11-27T08:41:02Z"
    title "Billie Eilish - Tourette syndrome "
    description "Billie, spoke out about her having tourette's syndrome and this honestly makes me love her in a different type of way because I myself having tourette syndrome, knows what it's like to go through everyday things while having to deal with it and I'm just very proud of her for being able to speak out about it. &#10084;&#10;My second channel is &#10;&#34;Tourettes And Me&#34;&#10;I think I'm gonna start posting on there, i've been so busy lately and i've had it up for a while, so I hope people don't think I'm saying any of this for attention. It's not something you want to lie about. &#10;@tumblreilish&#10;@tourettes.chick&#10;&#10;* I'm very open about my Tourettes, I'm glad she spoke out about it , my words are everywhere, but its 3 in the morning and I'm really happy &#128514;*"
