    date "2022-06-30T07:25:39Z"
    title "Tourettes  I | Official Awareness Trailer | Tourette Syndrome Awareness Film | Movie Making Media"
    description "Somebody That I Used To Know (Jana Katharina Cover x Spheri&#225; Instrumental) by Spheri&#225; | https://soundcloud.com/spheriamusic&#10;Music promoted by https://www.chosic.com/free-music/all/&#10;Creative Commons CC BY-SA 3.0&#10;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/&#10;&#10;#Awarenessisapowerfulthing. Co-Written and directed by Jack RH O'Sullivan who lives with Tourette Syndrome, Tourettes &#38; I is a poignant story of trying to fit into the world when awareness is limited. The cast includes Ashton Cooper, Christopher Perifimou, Sarah Leigh, Josh Dudley, Christin Pruestel, Siobhan Bayford &#38; Billy Chandler. Cooper plays a young adult with Tourettes who goes through the trials and tribulations of life when his tics impacting him during a job interview. Going through prejudice and stress, he must learn to accept his Tourettes as a gift.&#10;&#10;&#127909;&#127909; We're on a mission to get the Movie Making Media YouTube Channel to 1,000 subscribers. Our channel is our way of getting content to you, and it means so much to our talented crew &#38; cast to see their projects be loved and enjoyed by so many. So help them out, help out our amazing growing talent, by subscribing to our channel and helping get them and their work seen by more! https://youtube.com/c/MMMMovieMakingMedia?sub_confirmation=1 &#127909;&#127909;&#10;&#10;Our Socials &#38; Links!&#10;Official Website: https://www.moviemakingmedia.co.uk/&#10;Directors Portfolio: https://jackrhosullivan.pb.online/&#10;-&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/MovieMakingMedia/&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/mmmediateam/&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/mmmediateam/&#10;YouTube: https://youtube.com/c/MMMMovieMakingMedia?sub_confirmation=1&#10;-&#10;Email: contact@moviemakingmedia.co.uk&#10;&#10;What We Do!&#10;We are Movie Making Media (MMM), an independent London based production company producing a range of short films, web series and other media content. Utilising both Anamorphic and Spherical Digital formats; we cover all genres, from science fiction to mystery, with a range of projects in production! We also offer commercial videography and photography services to all types of people, using our unique film style to give a fantastic end product, with attention to every little detail.&#10;&#10;Tags&#10;#tourettes #tourettesawareness #shortfilmnews #shortfilmposter #shortfilm #shortfilms #shortfilmfestival #shortfilmshoot #tamilshortfilm #shortfilmmaking #thrillershortfilm #shortfilmmakers #bestshortfilm #shortfilmmaker #shortfilmcorner #shortfilmfest #shortfilmscreening #shortfilmcompetition #indieshortfilm #shortfilmproject #shortfilming #instashortfilm #shortfilmcontest #newshortfilm #shortfilmdirector #shortfilmproduction"
