  node [
    id 276
    label "u7QEwejKpMM"
    step 0
    date "2020-01-06T22:02:15Z"
    title "How to Help Your Spouse with Tourette Syndrome"
    description "Hi Everyone! This week's video is based on a viewers question who wanted to know how to help their spouse through Tourette Syndrome. I know the answer probably seems kind of simple, but it is so true. Simply just knowing that my husband is there for me helps me get through so many bad days, knowing that he won't get tired of me, or annoyed by my body constantly moving is such a  relief in so many ways. It can be hard to find a way to help calm someone's storms, especially when there really isn't anything most people can do, but just being patient and kind is key! I hope you enjoy the video and please keep the questions coming, I love all the requests I am getting on topics! Also don't forget to subscribe and share with all your family and friends and find me on facebook.com/oneticatatime!"
    channeltitle "Britney Wolf"
