    step 0
    date "2020-01-12T15:36:35Z"
    title "Tourette Syndrome and Dogs"
    description "This week I wanted to talk to you about how much a pet, especially dogs can help someone with Tourette Syndrome or other disorders or mental health issues a person may be going through. My first hand experience is with dogs so that is the topic I mainly focus on and explain how my two dogs, Izzy and Brooklyn help me get through the really bad days. I hope you guys enjoy it and remember to share with your friends and family to keep spreading awareness! Don't forget to also subscribe to my page and keep the questions and topic suggestions coming!"
