    title "GOAT TOURETTEs real)"
    description "Here's Mr Tumnus (a goat with Tourettes syndrome!)&#10;&#10;Whether goats with Tourettes is real or not, it's flipping funny!&#10;&#10;Tourette syndrome (abbreviated as TS or Tourette's) is a common neurodevelopmental disorder that begins in childhood or adolescence.&#10;&#10;It is characterized by multiple movement (motor) tics and at least one vocal (phonic) tic.&#10;&#10;Common tics are blinking, coughing, throat clearing, sniffing, and facial movements.&#10;-&#10;OUR WEBSITE:&#10;https://www.porpeangfarmthailand.com/&#10;-&#10;OUR LIVING IN THAILAND BLOG:&#10;https://www.porpeangfarmthailand.com/blog-thailand&#10;-&#10;LINKED PLAYLIST:&#10;GOAT FARMING&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gZzw40IUzZ0&#38;list=PLDkSgWZnokfz97h5SSFdkTBJ_X9J-PctT&#10;-&#10;JOIN OUR OFFICIAL TEAM&#10;PATREON: https://www.patreon.com/kartoongallagher&#10;-&#10;MAKE A DIFFERENCE ON OUR FARM&#10;PAYPAL: kartoonthai@hotmail.com&#10;-&#10;DON&#34;T MISS OUR LATEST THAILAND VIDEO:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHIhnkf0cQLZwdn7ZYBE-Jg&#10;-&#10;EMAIL:&#10;leighgal71@gmail.com&#10;-&#10;#ToonandLeigh #KartoonGallagher #Goats"
