  node [
    id 324
    label "sB2kmedBecg"
    step 0
    date "2021-07-02T10:00:27Z"
    title "PsyPop Ep.10: Tourettes Syndrome"
    description "Tourette's Syndrome is a type of tic disorder where repetitive involuntary movements and vocal sounds that affect one's daily functioning. Not many people are completely informed about what it really is and how it really works. Sadly, this has led to pop culture media misrepresenting people with the disorder by over-exaggerating it or making it comical, which only further fuels the fire of more people misunderstanding those with TS. In reality, there are many people who are still successful despite having Tourette's, and we should still regard them as normal people. In this episode of PsyPop, we shed some light on what TS really is and clear up misconceptions around it. &#10;&#10;Don't forget to like, subscribe, and hit the notification bell! &#10;&#10;Follow our social media!&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/psypoints&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/psypoints&#10;&#10;For any inquiries, contact us here!&#10;psypointsph@gmail.com&#10;&#10;- ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ -&#10;&#10;SOURCES&#10;&#10;Calder-Sprackman, S. Doja, A., &#38; Sutherland, S. (2016). The portrayal of Tourette's Syndrome in Film and Television. American Academy of Neurology, 1. https://n.neurology.org/content/78/1_Supplement/P06.041&#10;&#10;&#34;History of Tourettes&#34;. (n.d.). Tourette's Syndrome: Understanding the Disorder. https://www.tourettessyndrome.org/history-of-tourettes.php&#10;&#10;&#34;Mozart 'Suffered from Tourettes'&#34;. (2004). Evening Standard. https://www.standard.co.uk/hp/front/mozart-suffered-from-tourettes-6972372.html&#10;&#10;&#34;Tourette Syndrome Fact Sheet&#34;. (2021). National Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke. https://www.ninds.nih.gov/disorders/patient-caregiver-education/fact-sheets/tourette-syndrome-fact-sheet&#10;&#10;&#34;Tourette Syndrome&#34;.T (2021). MedlinePlus. Retrieved June 17, 2021 from https://medlineplus.gov/genetics/condition/tourette-syndrome&#10;&#10;- ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ - ~ -&#10;&#10;MUSIC CREDIT&#10;Hold On - Prod. Riddleman&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y8uUbYvhtBA"
