    step 0
    date "2022-05-12T13:51:34Z"
    title "Explaining Coprolalia (Tourettes Mixed up Mind"
    description "good day, lovely people!&#10;&#10;In today's video, I'll be explaining a little bit about coprolalia and what exactly it is, and how it affects us.&#10;Coprolalia is a tic where you might say anything that is inappropriate, offensive, or obscene and it is an incredibly socially stigmatized symptom that affects between 10-15% of those with Tourette syndrome.&#10;Copropraxia is a tic where you may involuntarily make inappropriate movements or gestures.&#10;&#10;I'd like to use this channel to educate and spread awareness on Tourette's Syndrome.&#10;&#10;Thanks for watching!&#10;&#10;Find my socials in the channel description!"
