    description "Tourette Syndrome itu bukan Tiktok Syndrome ok.&#10;&#10;&#9733;&#9733;Video terbaru saya&#9733;&#9733; :&#10;https://youtu.be/viDwJqVgrGw&#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;&#10;&#9733;&#9733; Part 2 &#9733;&#9733; &#10;https://youtu.be/Il7XxE5EEis &#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;&#9733;&#9733; Part 3 &#9733;&#9733;&#10;Tourette in the garden : https://youtu.be/Af9nPhIU6Zo &#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;&#10;Subscribe ya :)&#10;&#10;Halo guys&#10;Assalamualaikum &#10;Welcome back to my channel, in this video i just want to try not tics for as long as possible&#10;Here I just want to know how long I can hold this tics or tourette syndrome, But before I start, help subscribe to this channel and share it with your friends&#10;&#10;So we just start&#10;Actually, if I just stay silent, the tics won't come back&#10;but when I do activities like talking, the tics will come&#10;We repeat once more&#10;When I endured this tourette syndrome, I felt my brain ache and also from the brain to the eye of the pain&#10;&#10;Okay, maybe this video is enough, thank you for watching, hopefully you guys like this video.&#10;&#10;Don't forget to subscribe to this channel, like comment and share with your friends and if there are suggestions just write it in the comments column, if you have the same thing as me you can join the Facebook group that I have provided in the video description.&#10;&#10;That's all from me, don't forget to respect people&#10;Wassalamualaikum see you in the next video&#10;&#10;Do i make videos? &#10;Kira-kira saya bikin video apalagi?&#10;&#10;&#9733;&#9733;Extreme Tourette While Eating&#9733;&#9733;&#10;https://youtu.be/mOrSoPZFeTE &#10;&#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;You can donate via paypal : hamdaku21@gmail.com.&#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;&#9733;&#9733;For Business&#9733;&#9733; : reikanmr21@gmail.com.&#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;&#9733;&#9733;My Blog&#9733;&#9733; : http://bit.ly/Imtourette1&#10;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#10;&#10;Sindrom Tourette&#10;tics tourette&#10;Tourette Syndrome di indonesia&#10;Try not to tics Indonesia&#10;billie eilish tics&#10;Try not to move challenge&#10;&#10;&#10;#tics #tourette #syndrome"
